# RentaLista architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TB
  User[User browser] --> CF[CloudFront]
  CF --> S3Web[S3 static Next.js]
  CF -->|"/demo-portal/*"| API[FastAPI Lambda]
  CF -->|"/api/* cache disabled"| API
  API --> DDB[(DynamoDB cases jobs)]
  API --> S3Data[(S3 documents)]
  API -->|InvokeAgentRuntime| RT[AgentCore Runtime]
  RT --> Strands[RentaLista Agent Strands]
  Strands --> Bedrock[Amazon Bedrock Nova Micro]
  Strands --> Rec[Document Recovery Agent]
  Rec --> GW[AgentCore Gateway Web Search]
  Rec --> Br[AgentCore Browser + Live View]
  Br --> Portal[demo-portal synthetic]
  Strands --> Engine[Deterministic Form 210 engine]
  Engine --> Draft[Draft210 + ledger]
```
